{{!
    @template minilessonitem_multichoicequiz/multichoicequizresults

    The answer details panel of a multichoice quiz item in the attempt review: the feedback of
    each question that has some, under the question it belongs to. Rendered by
    mod_minilesson/quizfinished, from the data prepared in itemtype::prepare_result().

    Context variables required for this template:
    * feedbacks - array of objects, each with questiontext, feedback and the translate fields
      that mod_minilesson/translatetext needs

    Example context (json):
    {
        "feedbacks": [
            {
                "questiontext": "Why does the big man lean on the car?",
                "feedback": "He has just jogged to the car, so he leans on it to catch his breath.",
                "cantranslatetext": false
            }
        ]
    }
}}
{{#feedbacks}}
<div class="ml_mcq_correctfeedback m-2 p-2 bg-light">
    <div class="ml_mcq_feedbackquestion font-weight-bold">{{questiontext}}</div>
    {{{feedback}}}
    {{> mod_minilesson/translatetext}}
</div>
{{/feedbacks}}
